    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>mTLS Client for Secure Shard-to-Shard Communication</para>
<para>Implements mutual TLS (mTLS) for authenticated and encrypted communication between shards. Both client and server present certificates during the TLS handshake.</para>
<para>Features:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Mutual TLS authentication</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Certificate verification against Root CA</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>CRL (Certificate Revocation List) checking</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Connection pooling and reuse</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Automatic retry with exponential backoff </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
